  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-323",
  "title": "Prompt",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Prompt"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I would like your help refactoring this app into a clean, generic, multi-tenant app scaffold I can use for future projects."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'll be selling it as a template for dev teams to get up & running quickly with fullstack convex+nextjs projects. It will include everything they need from the jump, and I will use it often for future projects. We're calling it TurtleKit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Its current state is based on a twitch-esque public access tv app I'm working on, but I wanna purge the stuff we don't need and make this into a clean, clinical, fully featured, high velocity, opinionated plug & play convex+react starterkit with documentation for how to use the template."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In the future the template will be generated with a CLI, but for now lets just clear everything out and optimize the end user experience later."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}